// Title: Suspicious Program Names
// Rule ID: efdd8dd5-cee8-4e59-9390-7d4d5e4dd6f6
// Severity: high
// Tags: attack.execution, attack.t1059
// Category: process_creation
// Product: windows
// Pipeline: microsoft_xdr
// Source: /home/user/Sigma_KQL/sigma_rules/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_susp_progname.yml
